            <div xml:id="d446">

                <pb facs="0551" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg477"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/949</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-13T01:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 13</hi> [<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >14</hi>], <hi rendition="#italic">1918, 1 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received January 15, 4.05
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2230. Rumanian Minister and entire Legation arrested 8 this [last] evening. Cause
                    unknown, but supposed to be account occurrences in Rumania. Have called meeting
                    entire Diplomatic Corps noon to-morrow [to-day] at American Embassy to consider
                    this unique proceeding which deplorable from every viewpoint.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
